[{"client_msg_id":"7081cab6-1ed5-48ea-bcbd-f9b335e698bc","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"文脈わからんので見当違いだったら申し訳ない\n1つめ→ddc v0.15.0 では問題なさそう。\n3つめ→わからぬ\n4つめ→cwd, buf ベース以外に、.git/などを探したプロジェクト補完をします、オプションで無効化できます。","ts":"1634212819.020300","thread_ts":"1634096909.016800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3cOtJ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"0fdc7ac8-64af-4167-a969-bdb1a78b3353","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"既知の問題の整理\n• ddc-fileでディレクトリ名補完の直後の/のあとは必ず補完されない。ただしその状態で/を消して再入力すると補完候補がでる\n• ddc-bufferでなかなかcacheが構築されない (InsertLeaveしたりいろいろしても) が、忘れたころに急に構築される\n• ddc-fileで../補完がされない\n• ddc-fileでたまに(pwdともバッファのpwdとも)全然関係ないファイルが補完される","ts":"1634096909.016800","thread_ts":"1634096909.016800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fvGT"}]}},{"type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"\u003c@US5UW1UNB\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1634212393.020100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
